  {
   "name": "connect_custom_webhook",
   "title": "Connect custom webhook",
   "description": "Connect a deployed webhook endpoint as this website's publishing destination. AutomatedSEO first sends it a connection test and saves nothing unless the endpoint accepts it. Once connected, approved articles waiting for a destination are queued to publish there. webhookToken is the random token (at least 32 characters) generated for this endpoint, of which the site stores only a SHA-256 digest; never pass any other password or key. A website publishes to one CMS at a time: pass connectionId to replace an existing webhook's details; any other CMS must be disconnected first.",
