   "description": "Queue publication of an already-approved article through a connected CMS. This can change external website state. MCP cannot approve content; the target article must already be approved or the workspace autonomy policy must explicitly allow publication. The request must include the target article, connection, and idempotency key; CMS health and content-version checks still apply.",
